diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index a3b95b8e3b..ad8942ae20 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -91,6 +91,9 @@ Miscellaneous:
 - Synaptic fractions: colors of groups and partners can now be changed through
   legend of graph.
 
